BT /F1 10 Tf 28 634.6 Td (2. What is the defining principle of great workplaces according to the employee view?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 621.6 Td (Answer: Trust built through management credibility, respect, and fairness \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 602.6 Td (3. Which best practice involves uncovering and recognizing special skills and experimenting with roles for the right fit?) Tj ET
