BT /F1 10 Tf 44 595.6 Td (Correct answer: observational study / observational) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 576.6 Td (3. What sampling bias occurs when only those with strong opinions opt in to participate?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 563.6 Td (Answer: Voluntary Response Bias. \227 Correct \(accepted by AI check\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 550.6 Td (Correct answer: voluntary response bias / voluntary response) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 531.6 Td (4. What is the process of randomly assigning subjects to treatments to balance out other variables?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 518.6 Td (Answer: Random Assignment. \227 Correct \(accepted by AI check\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 505.6 Td (Correct answer: random assignment / randomization) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 486.6 Td (5. What do you call improvement that occurs simply because subjects believe they got a special treatment?) Tj ET
